<title>SINGAPORE: Hai Sun Hup half year net up 9.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Hai Sun Hup half year net up 9.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 14.71    vs    13.44</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		     3.40    vs     3.40</p>
<p>    Turnover				   180.62   vs  159.99</p>
<p>    Interest income			    4.98   vs    4.22</p>
<p>    Interest expense			  11.38   vs    8.17</p>
<p>    Depreciation				12.73   vs   10.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			    15.99   vs   15.13</p>
<p>    Tax					    1.07   vs    1.54</p>
<p>    Minorities			 (loss)  0.22   vs    0.15(loss)</p>
<p>Note - Shipping and hotels company, Hai Sun Hup Group Ltd said the higher turnover was contributed mainly by the hotel division. The weak shipping industry contributed to a further deterioration in the agency business.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080) sd at</p>
